%% M9 sequence: a status change becomes an e-mail and an SMS.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor CO as Courier
    participant PS as parcel-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant NS as notification-service
    participant DB as MongoDB notifications
    participant MP as Mailpit SMTP
    CO->>PS: PATCH /courier/parcels/{id}/status (DELIVERED)
    PS->>PS: one transaction: parcel, history, outbox_event
    PS-->>CO: 200 OK
    PS->>K: outbox relay publishes ParcelStatusChanged
    K->>NS: deliver to group notification-service
    NS->>DB: insert consumer_idempotency (consumer:eventId)
    alt duplicate event
        DB-->>NS: duplicate key
        NS->>K: commit offset, nothing sent
    else first delivery
        NS->>DB: read parcel_contacts and notification_preferences
        DB-->>NS: e-mail on, SMS on, status opted in
        NS->>MP: send the templated e-mail
        NS->>DB: insert sms_outbox, notifications, notification_logs
        NS->>K: commit offset
    end
